{
  "uid": "commerce-payment-incident",
  "title": "결제 사고(미확인·종결·알림)",
  "tags": [
    "commerce",
    "payment",
    "week10"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "미확인 결제 상태별",
      "description": "PAYMENT_PENDING인 PG 결제 기록 수(send_started·pending·unknown·needs_review). DB 주기 조회라 갱신 주기만큼 늦다. 빨간 선은 critical 건수 조건 N=20.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentunresolvedpiling / runbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentneedsreview",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (status) (commerce_payment_unresolved)",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "시작 대비 결과 모름 유입 비율(30분)",
      "description": "최근 30분 결과 모름으로 새로 빠진 결제 수 / 새로 시작한 PG 결제 수. 빨간 선은 critical 비율 조건 X=0.2%.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentunresolvedpiling",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.002
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(commerce_payment_unknown_entered_total[30m])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(commerce_payment_started_total[30m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "유입 비율",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "종결 결과별 증가(10분)",
      "description": "주문이 결제 종결로 처음 바뀐 수, result별(confirmed·failed·not_sent·expired). failed 급증은 거절, not_sent 급증은 PG 연결 문제다.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentdeclinesurge / runbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentpgunreachable",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (result) (increase(commerce_payment_outcome_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "만료 종결 증가(10분)",
      "description": "결과를 확인하지 못하고 만료로 종결한 수. 빨간 선은 critical 조건 K=5.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentabandonedpiling",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(commerce_payment_outcome_total{result=\"expired\"}[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "expired",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PG 결제 시작 수(10분)",
      "description": "새로 시작한 PG 결제 수(유입 비율의 분모), provider별.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentunresolvedpiling",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (provider) (increase(commerce_payment_started_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (provider) (increase(commerce_payment_unknown_entered_total[10m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} 결과 모름 유입",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "결제 알림 상태",
      "description": "지금 pending·firing인 결제 알림. 각 알림의 runbook_url을 따라간다.\nrunbook: docs/runbook/week10.md#paymentunresolvedpiling 외 규칙별 앵커",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (alertname, severity, alertstate) (ALERTS{alertname=~\"Payment.*\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "runbook(docs/runbook/week10.md)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "docs/runbook/week10.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ]
}
